Subject: [PATCH] perf: compile the permalink path regexp once

Reuse the constant path matcher after the existing SiteURL prefix check.
Keep the pattern, whitespace/slash handling and URL acceptance unchanged.

Add boundary regressions and real history-page benchmarks with configured
SiteURL, external URL controls, same-site images and cached permalink previews.

Mattermax-Patch: permalink-regexp.patch
